<title>GERMANY: Holzmann details 8-month orders, sales.</title>
<headline>Holzmann details 8-month orders, sales.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output		8,538   down 1.1 pct</p>
<p>	 Of which domestic		     5,521   down 5.7 pct</p>
<p>	 Of which foreign			3,017   up 8.7 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   10,849   up 8.3 pct</p>
<p>	 Of which domestic		     6,871   up 7.6 pct</p>
<p>	 Of which foreign			3,979   up 9.6 pct</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		    15,768   up 16.6 pct</p>
<p>	 Of which domestic		     9,239   up 17.1 pct</p>
<p>	 Of which foreign			6,629   up 15.9 pct</p>
<p>    Staff					 53,293   up 8.9 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German construction group is Philipp Holzmann AG.</p>
<p>--FRankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
